WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.648
Raj: The last committed position matches our witness.

2
00:00:03.648 --> 00:00:07.559
Hannah: Does that include every acknowledged client write?

3
00:00:07.559 --> 00:00:12.743
Anika: Yes, acknowledgments require durable synchronous replication here.

4
00:00:12.743 --> 00:00:16.391
Lukas: Was synchronous mode enabled throughout this incident?

5
00:00:16.391 --> 00:00:20.302
Raj: Just to confirm, no asynchronous fallback, right?

6
00:00:20.302 --> 00:00:25.270
Priya: That's our working hypothesis. The audit looks reassuring.

7
00:00:25.270 --> 00:00:29.757
Hannah: Let me play that back. Verify replay too.

8
00:00:29.757 --> 00:00:35.397
Raj: Replay reached that position. We'll keep an eye on later records.

9
00:00:35.397 --> 00:00:39.932
Lukas: Good, but divergence remains possible until isolation.

10
00:00:39.932 --> 00:00:44.420
Priya: We can't rule that out yet. Isolation next.

